WEBVTT

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:08.844
After being rejected
by every hospital in Chicago,

00:00:09.044 --> 00:00:14.074
Candy found a job
at doctor Martin's hospital.

00:00:15.517 --> 00:00:21.387
One day, she got an invitation from Terry.

00:00:22.557 --> 00:00:25.219
Candy called Terry's name.

00:00:30.665 --> 00:00:35.466
Their own love

00:00:53.388 --> 00:00:55.117
Neil.

00:00:57.993 --> 00:01:02.489
Candy. What a pity
I am not the one you came to see.

00:01:02.639 --> 00:01:04.361
You tricked me!

00:01:08.036 --> 00:01:14.441
I was tricked. I just heard Terry's
name and ran quickly here.

00:01:16.211 --> 00:01:19.973
You look very upset, what's going on?

00:01:20.123 --> 00:01:25.418
Neil, what you did was absolutely awful.
I am going to leave right away.

00:01:26.421 --> 00:01:29.151
I would really like to see you try.

00:01:30.892 --> 00:01:33.690
Neil, what do you want from me?

00:01:33.995 --> 00:01:39.592
What? Nothing special.

00:01:40.902 --> 00:01:45.896
I just want to talk with you.
But in particular, not on the street.

00:01:47.109 --> 00:01:50.370
You keep avoiding me and you said
that you hate me? Say it here!

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:51.844
I hate you!

00:01:52.647 --> 00:01:54.239
That isn't true!

00:01:56.051 --> 00:01:59.112
Everybody would like me to marry
a girl from a rich family.

00:01:59.262 --> 00:02:05.786
I dated many girls
a lot more noble than you.

00:02:05.936 --> 00:02:09.556
But you're the one that I love.

00:02:09.706 --> 00:02:13.089
Love? Neil is in love with me?

00:02:15.137 --> 00:02:20.767
And I know inside your heart,
I'm the one you love, too.

00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:22.502
Me, in love with Neil!?

00:02:22.652 --> 00:02:27.640
Are you shy? Don't be afraid,
tell me how much you care for me.

00:02:33.421 --> 00:02:34.881
Do you want to know how I feel?

00:02:35.031 --> 00:02:36.183
Yes.

00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:44.191
I hate you!
How could I possibly feel otherwise?

00:02:44.341 --> 00:02:48.462
You hate me? How can you say
this after what I just said?

00:02:48.612 --> 00:02:55.670
You were mean to me from the first day
we met, and now you want me to love you?

00:02:57.245 --> 00:03:00.681
Now, Neil, get away, I want to go.

00:03:02.684 --> 00:03:04.549
Leave me alone, Neil.

00:03:05.453 --> 00:03:08.615
Candy, I, I...

00:03:08.765 --> 00:03:10.988
Leave me alone!

00:03:15.096 --> 00:03:16.757
Little bitch!

00:03:18.033 --> 00:03:20.092
Neil!

00:03:20.802 --> 00:03:26.666
Neil, open the door!
Neil, open the door!

00:03:26.816 --> 00:03:28.174
Candy!

00:03:29.711 --> 00:03:33.907
I'll let you go when
you admit your love for me.

00:03:34.057 --> 00:03:36.243
How could I say such nonsense!

00:03:36.393 --> 00:03:38.946
Then, I'll let you rot here!

00:04:00.508 --> 00:04:04.569
Candy, you want to jump?

00:04:16.224 --> 00:04:17.953
Candy!

00:04:37.279 --> 00:04:39.042
Candy!

00:04:52.227 --> 00:04:55.424
Candy, I will never give up!

00:05:11.379 --> 00:05:13.074
It's cold.

00:05:18.253 --> 00:05:22.986
No one's here. No car.
Where's this place?

00:05:34.035 --> 00:05:39.302
Everyone will worry.
I must get back quickly.

00:05:40.141 --> 00:05:43.440
Stop, please!

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:46.411
Candy!

00:05:48.183 --> 00:05:50.014
Mr. Albert!

00:05:52.087 --> 00:05:54.447
What happened, Candy?
I looked for you everywhere.

00:05:54.597 --> 00:05:58.551
Mr. Albert!

00:05:58.701 --> 00:06:01.755
Candy, why are you crying?

00:06:01.905 --> 00:06:07.097
It's OK. I just couldn't stop it,
when I saw you.

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:12.804
Look at you, you're all wet!

00:06:13.675 --> 00:06:15.835
I went to the lake for a swim.

00:06:15.985 --> 00:06:20.779
Let me give you the dress
I bought for you.

00:06:24.386 --> 00:06:25.645
Here.

00:06:26.095 --> 00:06:27.783
For me?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:35.059
I make good money working with animals,
so take it, please.

00:06:36.698 --> 00:06:38.996
Thank you so much!

00:06:42.337 --> 00:06:46.132
It was getting late,
so I went at Doctor Martin's.

00:06:46.282 --> 00:06:52.703
He told me a stranger took you in his
car, to the sea, so I got worried.

00:06:53.281 --> 00:06:55.772
You thought I was kidnapped?

00:06:57.285 --> 00:07:02.649
You are so cute, you have to be careful,
even though you could defend yourself.

00:07:02.799 --> 00:07:05.158
Mr. Albert!

00:07:06.461 --> 00:07:08.622
Just a joke.

00:07:09.297 --> 00:07:11.191
It suits you very well.

00:07:11.341 --> 00:07:13.257
Thank you so much.

00:07:29.918 --> 00:07:37.484
Mr . Albert... You are always there
for me when I need it the most.

00:07:37.634 --> 00:07:40.053
What happened tonight?

00:07:40.203 --> 00:07:45.158
I was told by an unknown man that
Terry was here and wanted to see me.

00:07:45.308 --> 00:07:47.427
It was all a big lie, it was Neil.

00:07:47.577 --> 00:07:50.266
Neil? That one, again?

00:07:50.538 --> 00:07:52.831
Do you know him?

00:07:52.981 --> 00:07:58.838
No, I have only heard about him.
He is from the Leagan family, right?

00:07:58.988 --> 00:08:05.512
Tonight he told me he loved me,
but I have always hated that man.

00:08:05.662 --> 00:08:11.287
What a strange way to tell
a girl he's in love with her!

00:08:11.893 --> 00:08:19.859
Am I too direct? But that's the truth.

00:08:20.009 --> 00:08:22.368
Maybe I was a bit harsh
by telling that I hated him.

00:08:22.804 --> 00:08:24.795
What's wrong, Candy?

00:08:25.473 --> 00:08:30.410
I was thinking that hate
doesn't bring anyone anywhere.

00:08:31.379 --> 00:08:33.973
I am afraid I won't be able
to live with her any longer.

00:08:34.123 --> 00:08:37.544
Soon or later, I'll have
to let her know my memory is back.

00:08:37.694 --> 00:08:41.646
I still need time.

00:08:54.435 --> 00:08:59.899
I can't believe Neil is in love with you!
If he only knew!

00:09:00.049 --> 00:09:02.435
What do you mean, doctor?

00:09:02.585 --> 00:09:06.639
What I mean is that you would be
a terrible wife.

00:09:06.789 --> 00:09:10.577
Is it because I refrain you from
drinking that I am so terrible?

00:09:10.727 --> 00:09:12.813
Of course not.

00:09:13.621 --> 00:09:16.616
Someone would probably see this
as a quality I suppose.

00:09:16.766 --> 00:09:18.454
Enough, enough.

00:09:19.294 --> 00:09:24.791
But, is that playboy
still going to come after you?

00:09:24.941 --> 00:09:26.959
I'd rather not think about it.

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:31.297
Doctor.

00:09:31.447 --> 00:09:34.934
Candy, it's time to get back to work.

00:09:35.084 --> 00:09:38.033
Yes, come in.

00:09:38.183 --> 00:09:40.673
- Good morning.
- Morning.

00:09:40.823 --> 00:09:41.674
- Good morning.
- Morning.

00:09:41.824 --> 00:09:43.512
Please sit down.

00:09:45.453 --> 00:09:50.083
Candy, what's Mr. Albert doing
these days?

00:09:50.233 --> 00:09:52.685
He is taking care of animals.

00:09:52.835 --> 00:10:00.627
Are you sure? I heard he spends
his days talking to strange people.

00:10:00.777 --> 00:10:01.661
What are you saying?

00:10:01.811 --> 00:10:06.766
People say you're the one brining money
while he stays home enjoying himself.

00:10:06.916 --> 00:10:10.637
That's not true,
he works hard every day.

00:10:10.787 --> 00:10:14.140
She is right,
and you shouldn't say those lies.

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:21.981
I saw him with my own eyes!
He was in a bar talking to strange people.

00:10:22.131 --> 00:10:25.652
If I were you I would be very careful.

00:10:25.802 --> 00:10:27.053
How is that possible?

00:10:27.203 --> 00:10:30.790
Stop talking like this,
you will upset her.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:35.094
We're just trying to help Candy.

00:10:35.244 --> 00:10:38.831
Yes, we don't want her
to be taken advantage of.

00:10:38.981 --> 00:10:46.906
That's right, this is strange.
The car, and then the clothes...

00:10:47.056 --> 00:10:51.511
I made lots of money at work.

00:10:51.661 --> 00:10:55.481
Can you earn so much money
by taking care of animals?

00:10:55.631 --> 00:10:57.224
What is going on, Candy?

00:10:58.693 --> 00:11:05.191
Doctor, please give me a minute,
I'd like to go to the animal institute.

00:11:05.341 --> 00:11:09.862
That's where Albert is working?

00:11:10.012 --> 00:11:11.564
Yes.

00:11:11.714 --> 00:11:15.234
OK, you can go.

00:11:15.384 --> 00:11:20.975
Thank you, Doctor Martin!
See you soon!

00:11:43.438 --> 00:11:47.302
Chicago Animal Research Institute,
here it is!

00:11:54.716 --> 00:11:57.477
There is no Albert here.

00:11:57.627 --> 00:12:00.282
No?

00:12:00.722 --> 00:12:03.182
- Do you know him?
- No!

00:12:03.332 --> 00:12:07.153
And we don't have any assistant,
we do the entire job ourselves.

00:12:07.303 --> 00:12:10.891
No, no!

00:12:25.213 --> 00:12:32.142
What does Mr. Albert do,
where does his money come from?

00:12:32.386 --> 00:12:36.215
I don't understand why
he would hang out with bad people...

00:12:36.365 --> 00:12:41.924
He lost his memory,
maybe they are using him.

00:12:48.536 --> 00:12:52.732
So, Albert doesn't work
at the animal institute.

00:12:52.882 --> 00:12:55.902
There must be some mistake.

00:12:56.052 --> 00:13:01.381
Candy, I think
we should keep faith in him.

00:13:02.016 --> 00:13:06.077
Yes, I didn't stop believe him,
but this situation is confusing.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:13.052
Let's get back to work. Remember that
your smile is the best medicine!

00:13:13.452 --> 00:13:14.587
Yes!

00:13:14.737 --> 00:13:17.358
That's good, Candy.

00:13:33.047 --> 00:13:35.914
Boss, wine.

00:13:37.385 --> 00:13:41.162
Young man, you already had enough.

00:13:41.312 --> 00:13:45.089
Give me wine.

00:13:45.359 --> 00:13:52.458
No, no, you already had enough.
We don't serve alcoholics.

00:13:52.608 --> 00:13:55.297
What did you say?

00:13:58.306 --> 00:14:00.734
You will have to pay for this.

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:12.461
He jests at scars
that never felt a wound.

00:14:12.661 --> 00:14:16.682
But soft! What light
through yonder window breaks?

00:14:16.832 --> 00:14:18.952
It is Terry!

00:14:23.297 --> 00:14:27.560
It is the East and Juliet is the sun!

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:32.532
Arise, fair sun,
and kill the envious moon.

00:14:32.682 --> 00:14:35.576
Terry, it's me, Albert.

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:38.104
I don't know any Albert...

00:14:38.254 --> 00:14:40.907
Have you forgotten the zoo in London?

00:14:41.057 --> 00:14:44.911
We were like brothers.

00:14:45.061 --> 00:14:48.447
Stop it. I am not Terry!

00:14:48.597 --> 00:14:49.977
Terry...

00:14:50.127 --> 00:14:52.218
Don't touch me!

00:14:53.661 --> 00:14:59.622
I don't know what happened to you,
but I refuse to fight.

00:14:59.934 --> 00:15:02.300
You don't want to fight?

00:15:03.938 --> 00:15:05.963
That's enough!

00:15:07.441 --> 00:15:12.038
I am ashamed of you,
you don't want to fight!

00:15:12.188 --> 00:15:14.440
You're an idiot,
I want to break your face!

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:16.058
You don't give me any choice.

00:15:16.208 --> 00:15:17.844
Bastard!

00:15:20.988 --> 00:15:23.047
You got to wake up!

00:15:24.959 --> 00:15:26.152
Stand up, Terry.

00:15:26.302 --> 00:15:28.161
Please, Terry, calm down!

00:15:28.729 --> 00:15:33.759
My name isn't Terry!

00:15:33.909 --> 00:15:35.301
Yes, you are Terry!

00:15:43.844 --> 00:15:45.810
Is this one of your friends?

00:15:47.048 --> 00:15:52.884
He's been coming here every day
and he gets drunk every time.

00:15:56.157 --> 00:15:58.084
Boss, give me a bucket of water.

00:15:58.234 --> 00:16:01.720
I am sure this will help.

00:16:10.104 --> 00:16:12.197
Are you feeling any better, Terry?

00:16:13.441 --> 00:16:18.105
Mr. Albert, please keep hitting me,
I deserve it.

00:16:18.255 --> 00:16:20.977
Terry...

00:16:44.505 --> 00:16:50.967
So, you've been wandering around
since you left the theatre.

00:16:51.345 --> 00:16:54.610
I needed to forget about everything.

00:16:54.982 --> 00:16:56.876
You mean Candy?

00:16:57.026 --> 00:17:02.321
The stage, my life, everything
seemed destroyed after she left.

00:17:02.556 --> 00:17:05.418
I want to find myself.

00:17:05.568 --> 00:17:08.054
Do you see clearer now?

00:17:08.204 --> 00:17:14.034
No, I got depressed and started drinking.
You see where it brought me to.

00:17:15.102 --> 00:17:20.466
I had some hope coming here in Chicago,
but Candy can't find me this way.

00:17:20.616 --> 00:17:22.101
She can't.

00:17:22.251 --> 00:17:26.238
Terry, don't give up, cheer up.

00:17:26.388 --> 00:17:32.274
Mr. Albert, it's too late.
I touched the bottom.

00:17:34.455 --> 00:17:41.287
No, you can get out of this mess,
you have lots of talents as an actor!

00:17:41.437 --> 00:17:44.857
No, the alcohol is killing me.

00:17:45.007 --> 00:17:48.208
Terry, you can't let you fall.

00:17:48.358 --> 00:17:54.166
You're not the only one hurt,
Candy is hurt as well!

00:17:54.316 --> 00:17:55.334
I know.

00:17:55.484 --> 00:17:56.936
You don't know anything!

00:17:57.086 --> 00:18:01.812
Candy got over this, so can you!

00:18:02.416 --> 00:18:04.976
Terry, come with me.

00:18:15.529 --> 00:18:17.656
Look at this.

00:18:24.338 --> 00:18:25.669
Candy.

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:28.067
How come is she working here?

00:18:28.217 --> 00:18:36.876
She got fired from the hospital,
but she never gave up.

00:18:37.026 --> 00:18:38.411
She kept going on?

00:18:38.561 --> 00:18:44.482
Yes, no matter what happens to her,
she never gives up.

00:18:45.326 --> 00:18:47.556
Her own way...

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:05.545
I don't want you to leave,
if only the time could stop.

00:19:07.148 --> 00:19:08.809
Terry...

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:12.978
Don't say a word,
let's just stay like this.

00:19:13.128 --> 00:19:17.285
Terry is crying! Terry...

00:19:18.058 --> 00:19:26.826
I must leave
the man I love me so much.

00:19:26.976 --> 00:19:34.008
Candy, please be happy.
Promise me to have courage.

00:19:35.943 --> 00:19:38.810
Terry, the same to you.

00:19:44.218 --> 00:19:48.848
Candy is gone.

00:19:52.226 --> 00:19:58.392
Terry, there is still time.
Go after her.

00:19:58.732 --> 00:20:02.495
Don't worry about me.

00:20:02.645 --> 00:20:08.270
Staying here is my choice.

00:20:09.076 --> 00:20:10.668
Terry...

00:20:11.812 --> 00:20:16.806
Yes, I chose Susanna.

00:20:17.851 --> 00:20:22.220
Goodbye, my Miss Freckles!

00:20:27.394 --> 00:20:31.724
Who's next? Is this you? Come in.

00:20:31.874 --> 00:20:33.392
Sister, does this hurt?

00:20:33.542 --> 00:20:36.868
No, I am a good nurse.

00:20:38.205 --> 00:20:43.040
Albert, I took a decision.
I am going back to the theatre.

00:20:43.444 --> 00:20:46.238
I will go my own way.

00:20:46.388 --> 00:20:49.642
Terry, go and talk to Candy, first.

00:20:49.792 --> 00:20:52.117
No, I think it's better not to.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:02.793
Farewell, Candy.

00:21:07.401 --> 00:21:14.170
Candy had no idea that Terry
was there, a few steps away from her.

00:21:15.175 --> 00:21:20.112
He decided to leave,
so she would keep on smiling.

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:24.000
